# Analytics Cache Hygiene - Requirements

## Trang thai

Draft de review.

## Muc tieu

Dam bao Redis analytics cache cua user duoc cleanup khi cac profile fields anh huong den analytics thay doi, cu the la:

- `timezone`
- `preferredCurrency`

Feature nay khong tao socket event moi. Frontend da co `user:profile-updated` de invalidate/refetch query. Feature nay chi xu ly backend cache hygiene de Redis khong giu analytics keys cu qua lau.

## Context hien tai

Analytics cache keys dang co dang:

```text
analytics:summary:<userId>:<range>:<timezone>:<preferredCurrency>:<from>:<to>
analytics:chart:<userId>:<range>:<timezone>:<preferredCurrency>:<from>:<to>
analytics:pie:<userId>:<range>:<timezone>:<preferredCurrency>:<from>:<to>
```

TTL hien tai:

```text
300 seconds
```

Da co helper:

```ts
invalidateUserAnalyticsCache(userId)
```

Helper nay scan pattern:

```text
analytics:*:<userId>:*
```

va `unlink` cac keys tim thay.

## Van de

Khi user update `timezone` hoac `preferredCurrency`:

- frontend da refetch data moi qua `user:profile-updated`
- analytics cache key moi se khac key cu
- nhung key cu cua user co the van ton tai trong Redis toi khi TTL het han

Du lieu tra ve thuong van dung vi key co timezone/currency rieng, nhung Redis bi giu cache rac va co the gay kho debug khi manual inspect cache.

## Pham vi v1

V1 chi invalidate analytics cache khi update user profile co field:

- `timezone`
- `preferredCurrency`

Khong invalidate analytics cache khi chi update:

- `name`
- `profilePicture`

## Ngoai pham vi

- Khong them socket event moi.
- Khong thay doi analytics cache key format.
- Khong thay doi analytics TTL.
- Khong thay doi frontend cache behavior.
- Khong cleanup report cache trong Redis vi report hien tai khong co Redis cache rieng trong scope nay.
- Khong flush toan bo Redis.

## Requirement chuc nang

### R1. Invalidate analytics cache sau khi profile update thanh cong

Khi `PATCH /users/me` update thanh cong va request body co `timezone` hoac `preferredCurrency`, backend phai goi:

```ts
invalidateUserAnalyticsCache(userId)
```

### R2. Chi invalidate khi field anh huong analytics thay doi

Neu request chi co `name` hoac `profilePicture`, khong can invalidate analytics cache.

### R3. Cache invalidation failure khong lam fail profile update

Neu Redis scan/unlink loi:

- API update user van tra success neu user update da thanh cong.
- Backend log warning/error de debug.

Ly do:

- Cache cleanup la best-effort.
- Khong nen lam profile update fail vi Redis cleanup loi.

### R4. Khong duplicate invalidation khong can thiet

Trong mot request co ca `timezone` va `preferredCurrency`, chi can goi `invalidateUserAnalyticsCache(userId)` mot lan.

### R5. Dung chung helper hien co

Khong viet logic scan Redis moi trong controller/service neu helper `invalidateUserAnalyticsCache` da dap ung scope.

## Acceptance criteria

- Update `timezone` thanh cong thi analytics keys cua user bi unlink.
- Update `preferredCurrency` thanh cong thi analytics keys cua user bi unlink.
- Update ca `timezone` va `preferredCurrency` chi goi invalidation mot lan.
- Update chi `name` khong goi analytics invalidation.
- Update chi `profilePicture` khong goi analytics invalidation.
- Redis invalidation loi khong lam fail `PATCH /users/me`.
- Existing socket `user:profile-updated` van emit nhu hien tai.

## Edge cases

- Redis khong co analytics keys nao: helper resolve binh thuong, API success.
- Redis scan error: log va tiep tuc response success.
- User update body co field khong lien quan: khong invalidate.
- User update timezone ve cung gia tri cu: v1 co the invalidate neu request body co `timezone`, vi controller khong can query old value de so sanh.

